NFL paper.pdf
NFLELO 2.tex
main.tex
Tracy_Walker_3030_draft.pdf

# Working documents kept local: an internal reference explicitly marked not for
# circulation, and a commissioned external review of the manuscript.
Crime_and_Slope_Project_Guide.pdf
GUIDE.md
deep-research-report.md

# --- manuscript and submission material ----------------------------------------
# This repository is the replication package: code, the aggregated panels it runs
# on, and the tables it produces. The paper, its supplement, the analysis plan,
# the journal checklist and the conference deck live with the submission, not
# here.
plos_manuscript.tex
manuscript_general.tex
PREREGISTRATION.md
SUPPLEMENT.md
SUBMISSION.md
PAPER.md
RESEARCH.md
DIRECTION.md
PILOT_RESULTS.md
talk_slides.html

# The JQC build and both assembled submission packages. These were tracked by
# accident: .gitignore named the PLOS manuscript but not the JQC one, so the
# anonymised manuscript, the title page carrying the author's name and ORCID,
# and both full packages were sitting in a public repository. That defeats the
# point of double-blind review -- a reviewer searching a distinctive phrase from
# the paper would land on the author's own GitHub account.
jqc_manuscript.tex
jqc_title_page.tex
Cover_Letter.pdf
submission/
jqc_submission/
paper/
packages/
archive/
